CORE
caller_plain.c
definition_static.c --pointer-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.precondition_instance\.1\] line 6 static array parameter x must provide access to its declared minimum: FAILURE$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A caller that sees only a plain-pointer declaration in its translation unit is
still checked against the static minimum of the linked definition.
